function initAudio(){if(audioCtx){audioCtx.resume();return;}audioCtx=new (window.AudioContext||window.webkitAudioContext)();const buffer=audioCtx.createBuffer(1,audioCtx.sampleRate*3,audioCtx.sampleRate),data=buffer.getChannelData(0);let last=0;for(let i=0;i<data.length;i++){last=(last+Math.random()*.04-.02)/1.02;data[i]=last*5;}noiseSource=audioCtx.createBufferSource();noiseSource.buffer=buffer;noiseSource.loop=true;const filter=audioCtx.createBiquadFilter();filter.type='lowpass';filter.frequency.value=1500;noiseGain=audioCtx.createGain();noiseGain.gain.value=settings.volume*.13;noiseSource.connect(filter).connect(noiseGain).connect(audioCtx.destination);noiseSource.start();const hum=audioCtx.createOscillator();hum.frequency.value=58;humGain=audioCtx.createGain();humGain.gain.value=settings.volume*.018;hum.connect(humGain).connect(audioCtx.destination);hum.start();}
function beep(freq=850,duration=.1,type='sine',volume=.1){if(!audioCtx)return;const o=audioCtx.createOscillator(),g=audioCtx.createGain();o.type=type;o.frequency.value=freq;g.gain.setValueAtTime(settings.volume*volume,audioCtx.currentTime);g.gain.exponentialRampToValueAtTime(.0001,audioCtx.currentTime+duration);o.connect(g).connect(audioCtx.destination);o.start();o.stop(audioCtx.currentTime+duration);}
function knock(){for(let i=0;i<3;i++)setTimeout(()=>beep(90,.17,'triangle',.65),i*370);}
function rumble(){beep(45,2,'sawtooth',.2);$('damage').style.opacity='.12';setTimeout(()=>$('damage').style.opacity='0',350);}
function footstep(){beep(65+Math.random()*25,.07,'triangle',.055);}
